sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Sender
    actor B as Receiver
    participant F as FastAPI and facade
    participant Service as ConnectionService
    participant Requests as ConnectionRequestRepository
    participant Edges as ConnectionRepository
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant Inbox as NotificationService
    A->>F: Send request
    F->>Service: send_request(A, B)
    Service->>Service: Acquire graph lock and validate pair
    Service->>Edges: are_connected(A, B)
    Service->>Requests: pending_between(A, B)
    Service->>Requests: save(PENDING)
    Service->>Service: Release graph lock
    Service->>Bus: ConnectionRequested
    Bus->>Inbox: Notify B
    B->>F: Accept request
    F->>Service: accept(request_id, B)
    Service->>Service: Acquire graph lock
    Service->>Requests: get(request_id)
    Service->>Service: Validate receiver, PENDING, and blocks
    Service->>Requests: save(ACCEPTED)
    Service->>Edges: save(Connection of A and B)
    Service->>Service: Release graph lock
    Service->>Bus: ConnectionAccepted
    Bus->>Inbox: Notify A
